            <div xml:id="m-baf80340-5b0b-48ab-a5aa-584d4388cbae">
              <lg xml:id="m-342b2bdd-6a36-462f-aad0-090e3920f69e">
                <l xml:id="m-ab4827b0-4816-4036-b2f3-51fd49c08b4a" facs="#m-486996ef-a6d7-4176-a6d0-758d675d09f8" label="ambiguous">1032</l><l xml:id="m-e3081a58-ad7f-4343-9292-7a545074eedc" facs="#m-9b404f32-104c-4346-afce-05a79d376a6c" label="text-like">13th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-d2a9712c-fe4f-4264-a302-a38df2521151" facs="#m-90a12186-ded3-47ab-8c48-ef1e59608ecd" label="lyrics-like">et pá-nis cor hómi-nis confírmet.</l><l xml:id="m-47601e3f-a642-429e-8151-cd9433ab7709" facs="#m-d5f87689-4768-4736-85b6-24989ff7d2ac" label="lyrics-like">in ó-le¬ 0,</l><l xml:id="m-544fb9dd-7d70-4506-bb43-b4a9c7426c8b" facs="#m-a67a0afb-7cd2-484e-8232-06bf5ac9f26a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-dcef3904-d1ed-4b0d-9c61-3110fdf6074d" facs="#m-49619145-e836-4553-a3e6-0c9fa74afa09" label="lyrics-like">(Ivificet nos, quaésumus Dómine, stérii: et páriter nobis expiatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-f2aed8d0-3324-414a-9aef-7fba7e83a9f6" facs="#m-7169529b-b9af-41d7-9993-05e814a119b8" label="lyrics-like">hujus participátio sancta my-l tribuat, et munimen. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-926b34ab-602a-432a-998b-150c49d39fdb" facs="#m-6fd9a57b-4a0f-4171-8477-c386457ca265" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-9dfdf7dd-e827-42fc-af62-8d5d1a45d04c" facs="#m-b78b15e1-e24d-420c-80b9-ca544dfbe7fc" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-dfa98f6d-0d79-4b81-a1bc-8e99b1c4f9a9" facs="#m-8c37805b-814c-4d1c-ba9c-d36f3c9cc0e8" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-4346f392-a5d3-4837-9f72-9803c13cb60f" facs="#m-81f0086d-e6b5-42ff-b657-f4306ac04632" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-8115f53f-9968-40a6-b292-8c523c6f610b" facs="#m-afad2b91-a2c5-4ae6-9f28-98395d7e930c" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-f05b6b13-40c6-444e-942e-32d0c6b043ef" facs="#m-9cd4d48a-8c21-41d8-88f1-5455b573a8a7" label="lyrics-like">Omo quídam “descendébat ab Jerúsa-lem</l><l xml:id="m-2efb64eb-9a37-4795-bf14-8ef82b05e0ef" 